# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says: Biome and the frontmatter/regex tests expect it,
# so a Windows checkout behaves like CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Token and class lists only ever grow, one line per component: two PRs that append at the same
# place keep both lines instead of stopping the land on a conflict (#906). Only for this file:
# union never fails, so a real edit-edit clash would keep both versions.
docs/css-api.md merge=union
